      "lyric": "[Verse 1]\nThey packed the boxes, left the key\nSaid, “You’ll be fine,” and wouldn’t see\nThe cup still warm beside the sink\nI watched the moving truck pull blink by blink\n\nI kept the light on like a fool\nKept every promise, broke every rule\nYou took the map, you took the road\nLeft me the house and called it home\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nI’m not angry, I’m not clean\nI’m the space where you had been\nSay my name, then say goodbye\nI learned to live on either side\n\n[Chorus]\nI got left behind, left behind\nWith your goodbye stuck in my mind\nYou got out, I stayed alive\nLeft behind, but still I drive\n\nOh-oh, I won’t disappear\nOh-oh, I’m still standing here\nLeft behind, left behind\nYou lost me once—don’t lose my mind\n\n[Verse 2]\nThe calendar turned, the paint went gray\nYour mother asked if I was okay\nI said, “Sure,” because that’s what you say\nWhen the truth costs more than you can pay\n\nI heard your voice through someone’s phone\nLaughing like you’d never known\nHow every “later” meant “not now”\nHow every vow became a doubt\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nI’m not bitter, I’m awake\nI know exactly what you take\nYou can keep the clean-cut lie\nI’ll keep the nerve to testify\n\n[Chorus]\nI got left behind, left behind\nWith your goodbye stuck in my mind\nYou got out, I stayed alive\nLeft behind, but still I drive\n\nOh-oh, I won’t disappear\nOh-oh, I’m still standing here\nLeft behind, left behind\nYou lost me once—don’t lose my mind\n\n[Bridge]\n(You said run, I couldn’t run)\n(You said wait, I waited long)\nNow the door is off its frame\nAnd I don’t answer to your name\n\nI was the one you counted out\nI was the doubt beneath your mouth\nNow hear me loud, now hear me clear:\nI’m not your past just ’cause you’re not here\n\n[Final Chorus]\nI got left behind, left behind\nBut I grew teeth inside the bind\nYou got out, I stayed alive\nLeft behind, but still I drive\n\nOh-oh, I won’t disappear\nOh-oh, I’m still standing here\nLeft behind, left behind\nYou lost me once—now lose my life\n\n[Outro]\nLeft behind—still alive\nLeft behind—still alive\nYou shut the door, I changed the side\nLeft behind—still alive",
